<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>Commercial Cleaning in Brevard County | Beachline Cleaners</title><script type="module" src="https://beachlinecleaners.com/.webmcp/bridge.js" data-packs="c2pa"></script><link rel="canonical" href="https://beachlinecleaners.com/commercial-cleaning/"><meta name="description" content="Cleaning for small offices, retail spaces, and shared work areas in Brevard County. Agree on the checklist, access, schedule, and price before service begins."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"><meta property="og:title" content="Commercial Cleaning in Brevard County | Beachline Cleaners"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:image" content="https://beachlinecleaners.com/og-image.jpg"><meta property="og:url" content="https://beachlinecleaners.com/commercial-cleaning/"><meta property="og:description" content="Cleaning for small offices, retail spaces, and shared work areas in Brevard County. Agree on the checklist, access, schedule, and price before service begins."><meta property="og:site_name" content="Beachline Cleaners"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Commercial Cleaning in Brevard County | Beachline Cleaners"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://beachlinecleaners.com/og-image.jpg"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Cleaning for small offices, retail spaces, and shared work areas in Brevard County. Agree on the checklist, access, schedule, and price before service begins."><meta name="theme-color" content="#006591"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><link rel="help" type="text/plain" href="/llms.txt" title="Site guide for AI readers"><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="/markdown/commercial-cleaning.md" title="Markdown version"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"LocalBusiness","@id":"https://beachlinecleaners.com/#business","url":"https://beachlinecleaners.com/","name":"Beachline Cleaners","telephone":"+13213239776","areaServed":["Cocoa, FL","Cocoa Beach, FL","Cape Canaveral, FL","Merritt Island, FL","Rockledge, FL","Melbourne, FL","Palm Bay, FL","Viera, FL","Titusville, FL"],"priceRange":"$$","description":"House cleaning, deep cleaning, move-in/move-out service, vacation-rental turnovers, and commercial cleaning across Brevard County."}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/about.BhHO6Xd5.css"></head> <body class="group/site max-mobile:pb-[calc(56px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]"> <a class="fixed -top-[100px] left-4 z-[100] bg-white px-[18px] py-3 text-ink focus:top-3" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a> <header class="header sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-line/70 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] nav relative flex min-h-[78px] items-center gap-card-gap max-mobile:min-h-[70px] max-mobile:gap-3 group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:gap-[15px]"> <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap no-underline" href="/" aria-label="Beachline Cleaners home"> <span class="brand-mark relative size-[38px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[50%_50%_46%_54%] bg-sea-dark group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:size-8" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="grid leading-none"> <span class="text-[1rem] font-black tracking-[-.035em] text-ink group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-[.9rem] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-label">Beachline Cleaners</span> <span class="mt-1 text-[.62rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-sea-dark max-wide:hidden">Home &amp; Property Cleaning</span> </span> </a> <button class="mobile-toggle ml-auto hidden rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-[14px] py-2.5 font-extrabold max-mobile:inline-flex" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-links">Menu</button> <nav class="nav-links ml-auto flex items-center gap-5 max-mobile:absolute max-mobile:inset-x-0 max-mobile:top-[70px] max-mobile:hidden max-mobile:max-h-[calc(100dvh-155px)] max-mobile:flex-col max-mobile:items-stretch max-mobile:overflow-y-auto max-mobile:rounded-2xl max-mobile:border max-mobile:border-line max-mobile:bg-white max-mobile:p-[18px] max-mobile:shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(28,65,91,.14)] max-mobile:[&.open]:flex group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:gap-control-gap" id="nav-links" aria-label="Primary navigation"> <details class="nav-services group/services relative max-mobile:w-full"> <summary class="text-nav font-bold no-underline hover:text-sea-dark aria-[current=page]:text-sea-dark aria-[current=page]:underline underline-offset-4 group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small list-none cursor-pointer max-mobile:py-2">Services</summary> <div class="nav-services-menu absolute top-[calc(100%+14px)] -left-[18px] hidden min-w-[220px] rounded-panel border border-line bg-white p-2.5 shadow-[0_16px_38px_rgba(28,65,91,.12)] group-open/services:grid max-mobile:static max-mobile:border-0 max-mobile:pt-1.5 max-mobile:pl-3"> <a class="text-nav font-bold no-underline hover:text-sea-dark aria-[current=page]:text-sea-dark aria-[current=page]:underline underline-offset-4 group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small rounded-[9px] px-3 py-2.5 hover:bg-mist" href="/residential-cleaning/">Home Cleaning</a><a class="text-nav font-bold no-underline hover:text-sea-dark aria-[current=page]:text-sea-dark aria-[current=page]:underline underline-offset-4 group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small rounded-[9px] px-3 py-2.5 hover:bg-mist" href="/commercial-cleaning/" aria-current="page">Commercial Cleaning</a><a class="text-nav font-bold no-underline hover:te