a-[current=page]:text-sea-dark aria-[current=page]:underline underline-offset-4 group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small nav-phone whitespace-nowrap max-[1021px]:hidden max-mobile:block group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:hidden" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> <a href="/quote/?service=commercial" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-nav font-extrabold group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:text-nav-compact group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:text-small max-mobile:w-full group-[.island-home]/site:mobile:max-wide:px-3">Get a Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <script type="module">const t=document.querySelector(".mobile-toggle"),n=document.querySelector("#nav-links");t?.addEventListener("click",()=>{const s=n?.classList.toggle("open")??!1;t.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(s))});document.addEventListener("click",s=>{const e=s.target;if(!(e instanceof Node))return;const o=document.querySelector(".nav-services");o?.open&&!o.contains(e)&&(o.open=!1),n?.classList.contains("open")&&!n.contains(e)&&!t?.contains(e)&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"))});document.addEventListener("keydown",s=>{if(s.key!=="Escape")return;const e=document.querySelector(".nav-services");e?.open?(e.open=!1,e.querySelector("summary")?.focus()):n?.classList.contains("open")&&(n.classList.remove("open"),t?.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false"),t instanceof HTMLElement&&t.focus())});</script> <main id="main-content" class="scroll-mt-20" tabindex="-1"> <section class="border-b border-line bg-white pt-12 pb-14 max-mobile:pt-7 max-mobile:pb-9" aria-labelledby="commercial-hero-title"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] items-center gap-14 max-tablet:gap-8 max-mobile:grid-cols-1 max-mobile:gap-7"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"> <span class="h-px w-10 shrink-0 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>Commercial cleaning </p> <h1 id="commercial-hero-title" class="max-w-[720px] text-[clamp(2.7rem,4.5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-.03em] max-mobile:text-[2.65rem]">Keep the workspace clean without adding another thing to manage.</h1> <p class="mt-6 max-w-[620px] text-lede leading-[1.6] max-mobile:mt-4">Routine cleaning for small offices, professional suites, retail spaces, and shared work areas. We build the checklist around your space, access requirements, and the schedule that works for the business.</p> <p class="mt-5 text-[1.2rem] font-bold text-sea-dark">Custom quote</p> <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-control-gap"> <a href="/quote/?service=commercial" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-sea-dark text-white shadow-[0_8px_22px_rgba(0,101,145,.16)] hover:bg-teal active:bg-teal min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Get a Quote<svg class="shrink-0 size-[18px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>   </svg></a> <a class="text-small font-[750] text-sea-dark underline" href="tel:+13213239776">Call (321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> <figure class="m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-panel bg-mist shadow-[0_18px_55px_rgba(28,65,91,.09)]"> <img src="/images/cleaner-office.webp" alt="Man wiping a desk in a bright professional office" width="1280" height="800" class="aspect-[1.2] w-full object-cover object-left max-mobile:aspect-[1.55]" fetchpriority="high"> </figure> </div> </section>   <section class="py-[74px] max-mobile:py-14" aria-labelledby="facility-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-6"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>Start with the facility</p> <h2 id="facility-heading" class="max-w-[500px]">Build the cleaning plan around how the space is actually used.</h2> </div> <p class="max-w-[760px] text-[1.08rem] leading-[1.72]">Start with the areas that need attention most, then choose a cleaning schedule that fits your working day.</p> </div> <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 border-y border-line max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:divide-y max-tablet:divide-line"> <article class="py-7 pr-9 max-tablet:pr-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-teal">Space</p> <h3>Facility type and high-use areas</h3> <p class="mt-3 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Tell us whether it’s a small office, professional suite, retail space, or another light-commercial workplace and which areas see the most traffic.</p> </article> <article class="border-l border-line px-9 py-7 max-tablet:border-l-0 max-tablet:px-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-teal">Schedule</p> <h3>One-time or recurring</h3> <p class="mt-3 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Choose one-time, weekly, biweekly, or a custom recurring schedule. After-hours or weekend visits can be arranged when availability allows.</p> </article> <article class="border-l border-line py-7 pl-9 max-tablet:border-l-0 max-tablet:pl-0"> <p class="mb-2 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.11em] text-teal">Access</p> <h3>Work around the building</h3> <p class="mt-3 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Include access requirements, timing restrictions, and any areas that need special handling when you request the quote.</p> </article> </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-line bg-mist py-[74px] max-mobile:py-14" aria-labelledby="commercial-scope-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] gap-16 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-8"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>Cleaning checklist</p> <h2 id="commercial-scope-heading">What routine commercial cleaning can include</h2> <p class="mt-5 max-w-[470px] text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.68]">Choose the tasks your space needs from the routine checklist below.</p> </div> <ul class="m-0 list-none border-y border-line bg-white px-7 max-mobile:px-5" role="list"> <li class="border-b border-line py-[17px] last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.6] font-[750] text-ink">Dusting and wiping reachable surfaces in offices, reception areas, conference rooms, and shared spaces</p> </li><li class="border-b border-line py-[17px] last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.6]">Restroom cleaning, including toilets, sinks, counters, mirrors, fixtures, and floors</p> </li><li class="border-b border-line py-[17px] last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.6]">Breakroom and kitchenette counters, sinks, tables, appliance exteriors, and floors</p> </li><li class="border-b border-line py-[17px] last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.6]">Vacuuming carpets and mopping suitable hard-floor surfaces</p> </li><li class="border-b border-line py-[17px] last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.6]">Trash removal, with recycling handled according to the arrangement for the property</p> </li><li class="border-b border-line py-[17px] last:border-b-0"> <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.6]">Wiping frequently touched surfaces such as door handles and light switches</p> </li> </ul> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-line py-10 max-mobile:py-8" aria-labelledby="commercial-plan-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <h2 id="commercial-plan-heading" class="text-[1.65rem]">Adjust the service to your workplace.</h2> <p class="mt-3 max-w-[760px]">Need more than routine upkeep? Tell us which of these options would help.</p> <ul class="mt-5 grid list-disc grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-3 pl-5 max-mobile:grid-cols-1" role="list"> <li class="pl-1">Recurring weekly, biweekly, or custom schedules by arrangement</li><li class="pl-1">After-hours or weekend visits, subject to availability</li><li class="pl-1">Detail cleaning for baseboards, trim, fixtures, and buildup</li><li class="pl-1">Interior entry-door and other accessible interior glass</li><li class="pl-1">Restocking restroom and breakroom supplies by arrangement</li> </ul> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-line py-[72px] max-mobile:py-10" aria-labelledby="commercial-price-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] gap-16 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-8"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>Custom pricing</p> <h2 id="commercial-price-heading">Pricing for your space and schedule.</h2> <p class="mt-5 max-w-[500px] text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.68]">Commercial quotes are based on the size and type of space, cleaning frequency, number of restrooms and shared areas, requested cleaning hours, and the final checklist. We confirm the scope and price before the first visit.</p> </div> <ul class="m-0 mt-5 grid list-none grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 border-t border-line p-0 self-start" role="list"> <li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Square footage</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Facility type &amp; layout</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Service frequency</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Restrooms &amp; shared areas</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Cleaning hours &amp; access</li><li class="border-b border-line py-4 text-[.96rem] font-bold text-ink">Agreed checklist</li> </ul> </div> </section> <section class="py-[72px] max-mobile:py-10" aria-labelledby="commercial-faq-heading"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[.62fr_1.38fr] gap-14 max-tablet:grid-cols-1 max-tablet:gap-7"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-sea-dark"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-sea" aria-hidden="true"></span>Business questions</p> <h2 id="commercial-faq-heading">Before service starts.</h2> </div> <div> <details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Do you clean after hours?</summary> <p class="pb-5 pr-8 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">After-hours or weekend cleaning can be arranged when availability and building access allow it. Include your preferred cleaning window with the quote request.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Can we customize the cleaning checklist?</summary> <p class="pb-5 pr-8 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Yes. Commercial service is based on an agreed checklist for your space. Tell us which areas matter most, any tasks that need special attention, and how often you want them handled.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Do you bring cleaning supplies and equipment?</summary> <p class="pb-5 pr-8 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">We bring standard cleaning supplies and equipment for the agreed service. If the property requires specific products or has delicate surfaces, tell us before the first visit.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">How do you handle keys, alarms, or building access?</summary> <p class="pb-5 pr-8 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">We work out access before service starts. If the building uses keys, codes, an alarm, a front desk, or another access process, include that when we set up the schedule. Do not send door or alarm codes through the quote form.</p> </details><details class="rounded-panel border border-line bg-white px-5 py-[19px] open:border-sea-dark/50"> <summary class="flex min-h-6 items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none cursor-pointer font-[850] text-ink hover:text-sea-dark">Can I request a one-time commercial clean?</summary> <p class="pb-5 pr-8 text-[1rem] leading-[1.65]">Yes. One-time cleaning can be quoted along with recurring service. Tell us the condition of the space and whether you need routine cleaning or more detailed work so we can price the scope correctly.</p> </details> </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-ocean text-white py-[66px] max-mobile:py-12"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center max-tablet:grid-cols-1 gap-10"> <div> <p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-eyebrow font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-cyan"><span class="h-px w-10 bg-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></span>Next step</p> <h2 class="max-w-[720px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-.035em] text-white text-[clamp(2.25rem,4.2vw,3.8rem)]">Need a cleaner?</h2> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[680px] text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.65] text-white/70">Tell us what you need cleaned and when you need it. We’ll work through the details with you and confirm the price before anything is booked.</p> </div> <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-mobile:w-full max-mobile:[&>*]:grow"> <a href="/quote/?service=commercial" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-transparent bg-white text-sea-dark hover:bg-mist active:bg-seafoam min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Get a Quote<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a href="tel:+13213239776" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-control-gap rounded-lg border no-underline transition-[transform,background,border-color] duration-200 motion-safe:not-disabled:hover:-translate-y-0.5 motion-safe:active:translate-y-0 disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70 border-[1.5px] border-white/70 bg-transparent text-white hover:border-white hover:bg-white/15 active:bg-white/25 min-h-[50px] px-control-x text-action font-extrabold">Call (321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> </section>  </main> <footer class="footer bg-footer pt-7 pb-5 text-white group-[.island-home]/site:bg-footer max-mobile:pt-6 max-mobile:pb-[calc(64px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] group-[.no-mobile-bar]/site:max-mobile:pb-[max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))]"> <div class="mx-auto w-[min(calc(100%-40px),1180px)] max-mobile:w-[min(calc(100%-28px),1180px)] group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:w-[calc(100%-36px)]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr_.7fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-5 max-mobile:grid-cols-2 max-mobile:gap-x-5"> <div class="max-mobile:col-span-2"> <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap font-black tracking-[-.03em] text-mist no-underline group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text" href="/"> <span class="brand-mark relative size-[38px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[50%_50%_46%_54%] bg-sea-dark group-[.island-home]/site:max-mobile:size-8" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="grid leading-none"> <span>Beachline Cleaners</span> <span class="mt-1.5 text-[.64rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-cyan">Home &amp; Property Cleaning</span> </span> </a> <p class="mt-3 max-w-[430px] text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text max-mobile:hidden">Local cleaning for homes, moves, vacation rentals, and workspaces across the Space Coast.</p> <div class="mt-3 flex gap-4 font-extrabold text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text"> <a class="flex min-h-11 items-center no-underline" href="tel:+13213239776">(321) 323-9776</a> </div> </div> <div> <strong>Services</strong> <div class="mt-3 grid gap-0.5 text-mist group-[.island-home]/site:text-footer-text"> <a class="w-fit min-h